---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="CV" description="CV of Sabine Rümmele (née Schleise) — Research Engineer at SICK AG, agentic software engineering and 3D computer vision.">
  <div class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
    <header class="mb-10 not-prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-50 mb-2">Curriculum Vitae</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Sabine Rümmele (née Schleise) · Research Engineer at SICK AG · Forward Deployed Engineer</p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="cv-h2">
        Skills
      </h2>
<dl class="not-prose grid sm:grid-cols-[12rem_1fr] gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        <dt class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Approach</dt>
        <dd>Problem analysis and requirements, deliberately small solutions, rapid prototyping, picking up whatever tool the problem needs</dd>
        <dt class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">AI &amp; agents</dt>
        <dd>Agentic coding workflows, spec-driven development, LLM integrations, image-generation workflows (ComfyUI)</dd>
        <dt class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">3D &amp; computer vision</dt>
        <dd>NeRF, 3D Gaussian Splatting, photogrammetry (COLMAP), learned 3D reconstruction (VGGT, MASt3R, DUSt3R), meshing, OpenCV, TensorFlow</dd>
        <dt class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Tools used so far</dt>
        <dd>Python, TypeScript, C#, Java, Flutter, Unity, Blender, Docker, GitLab CI</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="cv-h2">
        Awards
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        <strong>Erwin-Sick-Award</strong>: Recognized for an outstanding master's thesis on Neural Radiance Fields in the Context of the Industrial Metaverse.{' '}
        <a href="https://www.hs-furtwangen.de/zukunft-erleben/aktuelles/detail/978-junge-talente-ueberzeugen-mit-engagement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read more here</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="cv-h2">
        Talks
      </h2>
      <ul class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        <li><strong>Spec Driven Coding</strong>, Women in Tech Meetup Freiburg, October 2026</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="cv-h2">
        Publications
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        <li>
          <a href="https://opus.hs-furtwangen.de/frontdoor/deliver/index/docId/10260/file/embedded_world_2023.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Schleise, Sabine; Hahne, Uwe: "3D Computer Vision for the Industrial Metaverse"
          </a>, Embedded World Conference Proceedings, 2023.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://otik.uk.zcu.cz/handle/11025/57388" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Schleise, Sabine; Hahne, Uwe; Lindinger, Jakob: "An Automated Pipeline to Bring NeRFs to the Industrial Metaverse"
          </a>, WSCG Proceedings, 2024.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="cv-h2">
        Experience
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Research Engineer — SICK AG, Waldkirch</h3>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Since 11/2023</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Since 01/2026: Agentic software engineering, forward deployed and feature engineering</p>
          <ul class="mt-1 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1">
            <li>Identifying problems together with business teams and working out how to solve them, from requirements to working prototypes.</li>
            <li>Choosing the approach per problem, e.g. agentic coding workflows, LLM integrations or image-generation pipelines in ComfyUI.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">11/2023 – 12/2025: Reality capture</p>
          <ul class="mt-1 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1">
            <li>Explored whether current 3D computer vision methods can solve concrete customer problems.</li>
            <li>Methods included NeRF, 3D Gaussian Splatting, photogrammetry, VGGT, MASt3R, DUSt3R and meshing.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Lecturer — Hochschule Furtwangen</h3>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">10/2023 – 02/2024</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="mt-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1">
            <li>Taught the course <em>Management, Wertschöpfungsprozesse und Technologien</em>.</li>
            <li>Focused on delivering practical and theoretical insights into value creation and modern management technologies in the context of AI.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="cv-h2">
        Education
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Hochschule Furtwangen</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">03/2022 – 10/2023</span>
          </div>
          <p><strong>Master's in Media Computer Science</strong> — GPA: 1.3</p>
          <p>
            <a href="https://sabinecelina.github.io/masterthesis-nerf_mv/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Thesis: Neural Radiance Fields in the Context of the Industrial Metaverse
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Hochschule Furtwangen</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">03/2018 – 02/2022</span>
          </div>
          <p><strong>Bachelor's in Media Computer Science</strong> — GPA: 1.6</p>
          <p>Thesis: Implementation of an Application for Camera Calibration</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Karlsruher Institut für Technologie</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">10/2016 – 10/2017</span>
          </div>
          <p>Bachelor's in Computer Science</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Ludwig-Wilhelm-Gymnasium</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">09/2008 – 07/2016</span>
          </div>
          <p>Abitur</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Student Assistant — Hochschule Furtwangen</p>
          <ul class="mt-1 space-y-1">
            <li>Tutor in graphical data processing, <a href="https://www.hs-furtwangen.de/zukunft-verbinden/personen/profil/2932-uwehahne" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prof. Dr. Hahne</a></li>
            <li>Chief editor for LaTeX projects, <a href="https://www.hs-furtwangen.de/zukunft-verbinden/personen/profil/438-thomasschneider" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prof. Dr. Schneider</a></li>
            <li>Tutor in mathematics and physics, <a href="https://www.hs-furtwangen.de/zukunft-verbinden/personen/profil/438-thomasschneider" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prof. Dr. Schneider</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
